# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000323> (atmospheric boundary layer)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000323> "The atmospheric boundary layer is the lowest layer of an atmosphere which is strongly influenced by its contact with a planetary surface with strong vertical mixing and in which physical quantities such as flow velocity, temperature, and moisture display rapid fluctuations (turbulence).")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000323> "planetary boundary layer")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000323> "atmospheric boundary layer")
