AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000324> "A planetary surface is a surface layer where the solid or liquid material of a planet comes into contact with an atmosphere or outer space.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000324> "a useful class: this can be used to define sub-terrestrial and sub-marine entities")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000324> "planetary surface")
