AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000408> "Formerly, this class was an experimental class and a subclass of \"environmental feature\". It is now aligned to BFO. The class was not obsoleted as the core semantics maintained their stability through its transition.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000408> "environmental zone")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000408> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000024>)
