AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000639> "A planetary structural layer is laminar part of a terrestrial planet or other rocky body large enough to have differentiation by density. Planetary layers have differing physicochemical properties and composition.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000639> "planetary structural layer"@en)
