AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000741> "This has been created for SDGIO. Revision is likely, but the general meaning should be stable. The frame of reference for determining what is 'waste' and what is a  'resource' is unclear.")
