AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000755> "A part of an astronomical body which is primarily composed of a continuous volume of gaseous or aerosolised material held in shape by one or more environmental processes.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000755> "Similar, in spirit, to landform. This class may need to be split into aerosols and 'pure' volumes of gas.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000755> "aeroform"@en)
