AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Helium_planet") rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001147> "A helium planet might form via hydrogen evaporation from a gaseous planet orbiting close to a star. Low-mass white dwarfs may transition into objects which are essentially helium planets by hydrogen depletion through mass transfer to a massive object such as a neutron star.  Gliese 436 b is a candidate helium planet.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001147> "helium planet"@en)
