SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001431> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000057> ObjectUnionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00000446> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000635> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001226>)))

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001433> (terrestrial mining)

