AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/#iso:std:iso:21348>) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ultraviolet") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_21001216> "A radiation process during which electromagnetic waves or their quanta are emitted at wavelengths between 10 nm and 400 nm.")
