# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000486> (multilaminar epithelium)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000486> "Epithelium which consists of more than one layer of epithelial cells that may or may not be in contact with a basement membrane. Examples: keratinized stratified squamous epithelium, ciliated stratified columnar epithelium.[FMA].")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000486> "stratified epithelium")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000486> "multilaminar epithelium")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000486> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000483>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000490> (unilaminar epithelium)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000490> "Epithelium which consists of a single layer of epithelial cells. Examples: endothelium, mesothelium, glandular squamous epithelium.[FMA].")
